Description: Wait for the keyboard test client's sync point before looking for its window.
 The keyboard tests wait for the test client's window and then for its sync point. Waiting for the window can
 dispatch the sync point request, after which the wait for the sync point never returns, so the test hangs until
 meson kills it after 360 seconds and the build fails. Upstream commit c6a16523f, cherry-picked unchanged. It
 changes only the test.
Author: Jonas Ådahl <jadahl@gmail.com>
Origin: upstream, https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/mutter/-/commit/c6a16523fe12da77e2e9c687b132531808db5337
Applied-Upstream: 51.beta
Last-Update: 2026-11-05
